# Not committed on purpose: npm prunes platform-specific optional dependencies
# (rollup's native binary) from the lockfile, so a lockfile generated on one
# OS/libc breaks `npm ci` on another and the Docker build fails. Direct
# dependencies are pinned to exact versions in web/package.json instead.
